{"text": "Della put up her hair again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nervously and quickly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For a moment she stood still. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While a tear or two splashed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the worn red carpet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she put on her old brown jacket. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And her old brown hat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With the brilliant sparkle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Still in her eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She hurried out the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And down the stairs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stopped at a shop. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a sign that said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Madame Sofronie. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hair Goods of All Kinds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Della ran up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One flight of stairs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And caught her breath. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Will you buy my hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked Della. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I buy hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Madame. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Take your hat off. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And lets have a look at it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Down rippled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The brown waterfall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twenty dollars. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Madame. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lifting the mass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a practiced hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Give it to me quick. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Della.", "alignment": {"characters": ["D", "e", "l", "l", "a", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "e", "r", "v", "o", "u", "s", "l", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "q", "u", "i", "c", "k", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o",